### Balance of an account (publish an event to transacoes-financeiras-processadas first)
GET {{host}}/balances/5b19c8b6-0cc4-4c72-a989-0c2ee15fa975
Accept: application/json

### Invalid account id should respond with a 400 problem detail
GET {{host}}/balances/abc
Accept: application/json

### Account without balance should respond with a 404 problem detail
GET {{host}}/balances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported method should respond with 405
POST {{host}}/balances/5b19c8b6-0cc4-4c72-a989-0c2ee15fa975

### Health with the balance storage component
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Prometheus metrics (balance_transactions_*, resilience4j_circuitbreaker_*, http_server_requests_*)
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus